# Select Start, move, drop a bomb, pause, return to the menu, and exit.
at 180 key LEFT down
at 181 key LEFT up
at 200 key ENTER down
at 201 key ENTER up
at 300 key RIGHT down
at 301 key RIGHT up
at 350 key SPACE down
at 351 key SPACE up
at 700 key ESC down
at 701 key ESC up
at 730 key ESC down
at 731 key ESC up
at 760 key ESC down
at 761 key ESC up
